msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: こんにちは、統制機構の方とお見受けします。
#. JA:   僕は咎追いのカルル＝クローバーと申します。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_00"
msgid ""
"Ah, hello! You're from the Librarium, right?\n"
"I'm Carl Clover, a vigilante."
msgstr ""
"Добридень. Бачу, ви з Організації контролю. Я Карл\n"
"Кловер, мисливець за головами."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 申し訳ありませんが、「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」について
#. JA:   情報を提供していただきたいのですが。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_01"
msgid ""
"Pardon me, but I need to ask you a few questions\n"
"regarding Ragna the Bloodedge."
msgstr ""
"Перепрошую, але чи не могли б ви надати мені\n"
"інформацію про Раґну Бладеджа?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: え？あ、はい私は、統制機構のノエル＝ヴァーミリオン少尉です。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_02"
msgid ""
"Eh? Oh, hello. I'm Lieutenant Noel Vermillion of the\n"
"Novus Orbis Librarium."
msgstr ""
"Е? А, так. Я лейтенантка Ноель Верміліон з Організації\n"
"контролю."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 申し訳ありません、原則的に統制機構側から
#. JA:   直接「咎追い」の方へ対して情報提供は行っていません。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_03"
msgid ""
"Uh... I'm sorry, but Librarium officers aren't allowed to\n"
"pass information directly to vigilantes."
msgstr ""
"Перепрошую, але за правилами Організація контролю не\n"
"надає інформацію безпосередньо мисливцям за головами."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 情報を必要とする場合、
#. JA:   申請書を統制機構に提出していただくことになります。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_04"
msgid ""
"If you need certain information, you must fill out the\n"
"appropriate forms and submit them at the central office."
msgstr ""
"Якщо вам потрібна інформація, доведеться подати заяву\n"
"до Організації контролю."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ですが、ご返答まで最低でも２週間はかかると思います。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_05"
msgid "You should receive an answer in about two weeks."
msgstr ""
"Однак на відповідь доведеться чекати щонайменше два\n"
"тижні."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: どうしよう姉さん？この人、教えてくれる気はないみたいだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_06"
msgid ""
"What should we do, Sis?\n"
"She doesn't want to tell us anything."
msgstr ""
"Що робити, сестро? Схоже, вона не збирається нічого\n"
"розповідати."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ――やっぱりそうだ、あなたカルル君だよね？
#. JA:   士官学校小等部にいた。なんで、咎追いなんかに？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_07"
msgid ""
"Wait. You're Carl, aren't you? I knew it.\n"
"You were in the Military Academy.\n"
"Why are you a vigilante?"
msgstr ""
"Так і знала, ти ж Карл, правда? Ти навчався в молодшій\n"
"школі Військової академії. Чому ти став мисливцем за\n"
"головами?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: うん、うん……しょうがないよね、お仕事だから。
#. JA:   でもきっとこうすれば教えてくれるよ、だから悲しまないで。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_08"
msgid ""
"Right... Right. She can't do anything about it because it's\n"
"her job. But I'm sure she'll tell me if I do that, so please\n"
"don't be sad."
msgstr ""
"Так, так... Нічого не вдієш, це її робота. Але якщо зробити\n"
"ось так, вона напевно нам усе розповість, тож не сумуй."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ね、姉さん？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_09"
msgid "OK, Sis?"
msgstr "Правда, сестро?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: カ、カルル君、大丈夫！？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_10"
msgid "C-Carl, are you OK!?"
msgstr "К-Карле, ти цілий?!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: く……油断しました、今回は退散させていただきます。
#. JA:   また、お会いしましょう「ノエル先輩」。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_11"
msgid ""
"Guh...I wasn't prepared for that. I will retreat for today.\n"
"Let's meet again, Cadet Noel."
msgstr ""
"Кх... Я втратив пильність. Цього разу відступлю. Ще\n"
"побачимося, старшокурснице Ноель."

#. Key: ArcEveNO01_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: あ、待ちなさい！！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO01_12"
msgid "Hey, wait!"
msgstr "Гей, стій!!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 兄さんは、何と戦っているんだ？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_00"
msgid "Brother, what are you fighting with?"
msgstr "З чим же ти борешся, брате?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 少佐、ここにいらっしゃったのですね。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_01"
msgid "Major... I finally found you..."
msgstr "Майоре, ось ви де."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 自分は統合本部からの命を受けて参りました。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_02"
msgid "I've been given a direct order to come here."
msgstr "Я прибула за наказом Об’єднаного штабу."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 今なら命令違反も不問に付すというのが上層の意向です。
#. JA:   至急隊にお戻りください。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_03"
msgid ""
"They say that if you return right away, they'll overlook this\n"
"incident. Please, do as they say."
msgstr ""
"Керівництво готове не карати вас за порушення наказу,\n"
"якщо ви повернетеся зараз. Негайно поверніться до загону."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 貴様、5年より前の記憶がないとかいっていたな。
#. JA:   では聞くが、貴様の最初の記憶はなんだ？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_04"
msgid ""
"You don't remember anything before five years ago, right?\n"
"Let me ask you... What's the earliest thing you do\n"
"remember?"
msgstr ""
"Ти казала, що не пам’ятаєш нічого з того, що було понад\n"
"п’ять років тому. Тоді відповідай: який твій найперший\n"
"спогад?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ！？　少佐、今はそのような
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_05"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"Major, this isn't the time—"
msgstr "?! Майоре, зараз не час для..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 命令だ、答えろ。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_06"
msgid "Answer me! That's an order."
msgstr "Це наказ. Відповідай."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ……イカルガの焼け野原です、私はそこで助けられました。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_07"
msgid ""
"...The burning fields of Ikaruga.\n"
"That's where I was rescued."
msgstr "...Випалені землі Ікаруґи. Мене там урятували."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: では、やはり貴様の両親は。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_08"
msgid "I see... Then your parents?"
msgstr "Отже, твої батьки..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 義理です。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_09"
msgid "...They adopted me."
msgstr "Прийомні."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: はっ、そうか、そうなのか。はっはっは……ククク……、
#. JA:   やはり、お前は僕にとって「障害」だ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_10"
msgid ""
"Hah! I see... I'm beginning to understand now...\n"
"Hahaha... So, you insist on obstructing me after all!"
msgstr ""
"Ха, ось як. Ось воно що. Ха-ха-ха... Хе-хе-хе... Ти таки для\n"
"мене «перешкода»!!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: グハッ……貴様は、いつも、僕の、邪魔ばかり。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_11"
msgid "Gugh... You always...have to get in...my way..."
msgstr "Ґха... Ти завжди тільки й робиш, що стаєш мені на заваді..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 気を失ってしまった。少佐は最初から手傷を負っていた。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_12"
msgid ""
"...He's unconscious.\n"
"The major was injured prior to fighting with me."
msgstr ""
"Він знепритомнів. Майор був поранений ще до нашого\n"
"бою."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 何があったんだろう？それに、なぜ私の過去の話を？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_13"
msgid ""
"I wonder what happened?\n"
"And...why did he bring up my past?"
msgstr "Що ж сталося? І чому він заговорив про моє минуле?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 記憶、か。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_14"
msgid "My past..."
msgstr "Спогади..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO02_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 少佐はここの奥を気にしているようだった。
#. JA:   進むしか、ないか。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO02_15"
msgid ""
"The major was interested in whatever is further inside...\n"
"I guess I have to keep going..."
msgstr ""
"Майор, схоже, цікавився тим, що лежить далі. Доведеться\n"
"йти вперед."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 統制機構の地下にこんな場所があるなんて。
#. JA:   ！？　　そこにいるのは誰ですか？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_00"
msgid ""
"I never knew all of this was down here...\n"
"!?     Who goes there!?"
msgstr ""
"Не знала, що під Організацією контролю є таке місце...?!\n"
"Хто там?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ほう、それはアークエネミーか。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_01"
msgid "Hmm...is that the Nox Nyctores?"
msgstr "О, це Арк-Енемі?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 答えなさい！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_02"
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr "Відповідайте!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 私の名はハクメン。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_03"
msgid "I am...Hakumen."
msgstr "Моє ім’я — Хакумен."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: ハクメン？あなたの姿どこかで……嘘！？
#. JA:   本に描かれていた六英雄の。まさか、そんな！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_04"
msgid ""
"Hakumen? But...I think I've seen you somewhere before...\n"
"No... Impossible...! You're...you're one of the Six Heroes!?"
msgstr ""
"Хакумен? Я десь бачила цю постать... Не може бути!? Це ж\n"
"один із Шести Героїв, якого я бачила в книзі! Неможливо!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: では私も問う、貴様は何者だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_05"
msgid "Now it's time for me to ask a question. Who are you?"
msgstr "Тоді й я запитаю: хто ти?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: わ、私は世界虚空情報統制機構第四師団
#. JA:   ノエル＝ヴァーミリオン少尉です。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_06"
msgid ""
"L-Lieutenant Noel Vermillion, Praetorian Guard,\n"
"Fourth Division."
msgstr ""
"Я-я лейтенантка Ноель Верміліон із Четвертої дивізії\n"
"Всесвітньої Організації Контролю Інформації."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 其のような肩書きでは無い。貴様の存在を問うて居るのだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_07"
msgid ""
"I'm not interested in whatever you call yourself.\n"
"I was questioning your existence."
msgstr "Я питаю не про звання. Я питаю про саму твою сутність."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: そ、存在？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_08"
msgid "M-My...existence?"
msgstr "М-мою сутність?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 私は貴様を「しらない」。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_09"
msgid "I don't \"know\" you."
msgstr "Я тебе «не знаю»."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: な、何をいっているの？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_10"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about?"
msgstr "П-про що ви говорите?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: だが、斯うして私と対峙しているのは事実。
#. JA:   貴様も因子に招かれたと云う事だ。良かろう――
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_11"
msgid ""
"Well, I can't deny it... You are standing before me,\n"
"confronting me. Perhaps there is a reason for your\n"
"presence here... Very well."
msgstr ""
"Та факт лишається фактом: ти стоїш переді мною як\n"
"супротивниця. Отже, й тебе сюди привів цей чинник.\n"
"Гаразд..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_12"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_13"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_14"
msgid "Guh, how dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveNO03_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: えっ、消えてしまった。なぜ？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO03_15"
msgid "Eh? He disappeared... Why?"
msgstr "Е? Він зник. Чому?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: これ……みたこと、ある。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_01"
msgid "I've...seen this before."
msgstr "Я це... вже бачила."

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: なに？…………あれ、なに？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_02"
msgid "What? Huh... What?"
msgstr "Що?.. ...А це що?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_03"
msgid "Scanning: complete. Auto-mode: confirmed."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: これは、私の記憶？あなたの記憶？私達の記憶？あなた達の記憶？
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_04"
msgid ""
"Are these...my memories? Or...yours?\n"
"Mine...? Or are they...ours?"
msgstr ""
"Це мої спогади? Твої спогади? Наші спогади? Ваші\n"
"спогади?"

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Noel
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を同一体と認識。
msgctxt "ArcEveNO04_05"
msgid ""
"Scanning: complete. IFF determined. Processing...\n"
"Subject determined to be hostile."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль ідентифіковано як тотожну сутність."

#. Key: ArcEveNO04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNO_ArcEveNO05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNO.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
